
Step 1: Open your project folde
cd "C:\Users\PRADNYA\Civic AI"
Step 2: Check your current branch and changes
git status
git branch
Step 3: Switch to the dev branch
git checkout dev
Step 4: Pull the latest code from GitHub
git pull origin dev
Step 5: Create your feature branch
git checkout -b feature/ai-service-integration
Step 6: Check your branch
git branch
Step 7: Add your code
git add .
Step 8: Commit your changes
git commit -m "feat: implement AI service integration"
Step 9: Push your feature branch to GitHub
git push -u origin feature/ai-service-integration

Step 10: Create a Pull Request on GitHub
Open your repository: CivicAI PMC on GitHub
Select Pull requests → New pull request and choose:
Option	Branch
Base	dev
Compare	feature/ai-service-integration

Then click Create pull request.
Important: Before committing, check git status to ensure you aren't accidentally committing unrelated files or secrets from your .env file.